{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"square of a difference identity square of a difference identity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md","fileName":"Square of a Difference Identity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Square of a Difference Identity","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Factoring and Algebraic Identities]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Factoring and Algebraic Identities","Square of a Sum Identity","Difference of Squares Identity","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"square of a difference identity square of a difference identity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md","fileName":"Square of a Difference Identity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Square of a Difference Identity","heading":"Square of a Difference Identity","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The square of a difference identity is\n\n$$(a-b)^2=a^2-2ab+b^2.$$\n\nIt follows from the [[Square of a Sum Identity]] by substituting (-b) for (b), or by directly distributing ((a-b)(a-b)). The first and last terms are positive squares, while the cross terms combine to (-2ab).\n\nThe identity is reversible: a trinomial with this exact structure factors as ((a-b)^2). It should not be confused with the [[Difference of Squares Identity]], which has no middle term.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Factoring and Algebraic Identities","Square of a Sum Identity","Difference of Squares Identity","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"square of a difference identity square of a difference identity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Square of a Difference Identity.md","fileName":"Square of a Difference Identity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Square of a Difference Identity","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Factoring and Algebraic Identities","Square of a Sum Identity","Difference of Squares Identity","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}